<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ foreign debt NZ$79.8 billion at Dec 31 - SNZ.</title>
<headline>NZ foreign debt NZ$79.8 billion at Dec 31 - SNZ.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics New Zealand released the following data on Tuesday on New Zealand's total foreign debt as at December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>Figures are in billions of NZ dollars, and have been rounded. Figures before revision in brackets.</p>
<p>		  Dec 31, 1996    Sept 30, 1996     Dec 31, 1995</p>
<p>Total		79.8		78.0 (76.4)	  74.5 (73.4)</p>
<p>Official Gvt     22.3	     22.7		   22.4</p>
<p>Other sector     57.5	     55.3 (53.8)	  52.1 (51.0)</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
